Kaldi, OpenFst, OpenBLAS and CLAPACK
  https://github.com/alphacep/kaldi (Kaldi, Copyright the Kaldi authors,
  listed in its COPYING file)
  https://github.com/alphacep/openfst (OpenFst, Copyright 2005-2020 Google LLC)
  https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS (OpenBLAS 0.3.20, Copyright (c)
  2011-2014, The OpenBLAS Project)
  https://github.com/alphacep/clapack (CLAPACK 3.2.1, Copyright (c)
